          "type": "text",
          "text": "A bag contains cards numbered 1 to 5. Two cards are drawn at random without replacement, in order, and then a fair coin is tossed. Find the probability that the two card numbers total 6 and the coin shows heads. Give your answer as a fraction in simplest form."
        }
      ],
      "marks": 5,
      "primary_outcome": "2.2",
      "secondary_outcomes": [],
